"id":2598738863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a5Zuv","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T16:32:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T16:40:43Z","body":"The text might need bigger outline or some background. It's now always readable.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87e593e7-c65b-4376-96f8-348cf07a2f37)\r\nAlso the game freezes noticeably when enabling the overlay.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598738863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598801826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100829#issuecomment-2598801826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100829","id":2598801826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a5pGi","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T17:04:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T17:05:50Z","body":"> The text might need bigger outline or some background. It's now always readable.\r\n\r\nI can add a font outline size project setting for the debug menu specifically.\r\n\r\n>  Also the game freezes noticeably when enabling the overlay.\r\n\r\nThis is likely because getting the driver version is slow on Linux. [It's cached for subsequent calls](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp#L309-L312) but the first call can easily take 500+ ms. I remember seeing an issue about this, but I can't find it right now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598801826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599035705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100829#issuecomment-2599035705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100829","id":2599035705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a6iM5","user":{"log