KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T19:22:30Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T19:22:30Z","body":"As for TODOs:\r\n\r\n> Rename to something else than DebugMenu, e.g. PerformanceOverlay.\r\n\r\nMaybe DebugOverlay? In case it gets more info in the future.\r\n\r\n> Add a project setting to set the debug menu mode to use on startup.\r\n\r\nThis can be easily done via script, so not really needed.\r\n\r\n> Add a project setting to change the location the debug menu appears in? This could be needed for some games where it'd overlap with HUD elements.\r\n\r\nAlternative is just exposing the overlay Control, so you can reposition it. It's already possible to access it, so there is workaround.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599043237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4372898290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100829#issuecomment-4372898290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100829","id":4372898290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBKUh8g","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco